    "detailed_description": "<strong><i>Answer Me</i></strong> is a game where you can ask anything and answer with tactics to win.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Multiplayer - Majority Mode</h2>Ask anything here. Pick your answer wisely. You stay if your answer is the majority. Try to become the last player standing.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Multiplayer - Minority Mode</h2>You stay if your answer is the minority. Try to predict what others will do and surprise them!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Single Player</h2>We prepare many hard-to-answer questions for you. Pick your answer and see how players around the globe react to the same question.",
